# Set-password team number

`POST /accounts/set-password` returns `{ id, phoneNumber, teams, teamNumber }`.

After a successful set-password, stay on `SetPasswordPage` and show **Hello, your team number is {teamNumber}** in large text. Before Continue, show: **Let's remember the team number — write it down somewhere if needed.** Do not skip this screen or navigate to login until the user continues.
